{# === 店名を1本に統合 === #}
{% set shopName = store.name_full_en %}
{# === ヒーロー写真:スクランブルエッグバーガー(左) × ステーキバーガー(右・写真届くまで仮画像) === #}
{% set heroPhotoLeft = "/assets/scrambled-egg-burger.png" %}
{% set heroPhotoRight = "/assets/Wagyu_Big_Cheese_Burger.jpg" %}

  <div class="lang-switcher" role="group" aria-label="Language switcher">
    <button type="button" data-lang="en" class="active">EN</button>
    <button type="button" data-lang="fr">FR</button>
    <button type="button" data-lang="zh">中文</button>
    <button type="button" data-lang="ko">한국어</button>
  </div>

  <div class="halal-sticky">
    <span class="halal-dot"></span>
    <span data-i18n="badge_muslim_friendly">MUSLIM-FRIENDLY</span>
  </div>

  <div class="walkin-bar">
    GOOD MORNING, WALK-INS WELCOME &nbsp;·&nbsp; BIENVENUE SANS RÉSERVATION &nbsp;·&nbsp; 欢迎随时光临 &nbsp;·&nbsp; 예약 없이도 환영합니다
  </div>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero-wrap">
    <div class="sunrise-disc"></div>
    <div class="hero-photo-wrap">
      <div class="hero-photo-half">
        <img src="{{ heroPhotoLeft }}" alt="{{ store.name_full_en }} — Scrambled Egg Wagyu Burger" />
      </div>
      <div class="hero-photo-half">
        <img src="{{ heroPhotoRight }}" alt="{{ store.name_full_en }} — Wagyu Steak Burger" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>

    <!-- Hero 最上部の店名 -->

    <div class="hero-shopname reveal">
      <p>{{ shopName }}</p>
    </div>

    <div style="position:relative; z-index:1; text-align:center; width:100%; max-width:380px;">
      <p class="label reveal d1" style="margin-bottom:14px;">{{ store.city | upper }}</p>
      <div class="reveal d1" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
        <span class="stamp" data-i18n="stamp_morning_brunch">Morning &amp; Brunch Only</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="reveal d2" style="font-family:'Fraunces'; font-size:clamp(2.3rem,9vw,3.6rem); font-weight:600; line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:-.01em; margin-bottom:14px; color:#fbf1de;">
        <span data-i18n="hero_heading_html">Good Morning,<br/>
        <em style="color:#f0a631; font-style:italic;">Wagyu.</em></span>
      </h1>
      <p class="reveal d3" style="font-size:clamp(.85rem,3vw,.95rem); color:rgba(251,241,222,.78); font-weight:400; letter-spacing:.02em; margin-bottom:6px;">
        <span data-i18n="hero_tagline1">A fresh-griddled Wagyu burger to start your day right —</span>
      </p>
      <p class="reveal d3" style="font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-size:clamp(.8rem,2.6vw,.92rem); color:rgba(240,166,49,.92); letter-spacing:.04em; font-style:italic; font-weight:500; margin-bottom:28px;">
        <span data-i18n="hero_tagline2_brand">Halal Wagyu Morning Burger</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{ store.hero_place }}
      </p>

      <div class="reveal d4" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;">
        {% if store.maps_link %}
        <a href="{{ store.maps_link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary" data-ga-event="directions_click" data-ga-location="hero">
          <span data-i18n="cta_get_directions">Get Directions</span>
        </a>
        {% endif %}
        {% if store.tablecheck_url %}
        <a href="{{ store.tablecheck_url }}?utm_source=lp&utm_medium=referral" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-secondary" data-ga-event="reserve_click" data-ga-location="hero">
          <span data-i18n="cta_reserve_table">Reserve a Table</span>
        </a>
        {% elif store.tel_raw %}
        <a href="tel:{{ store.tel_raw }}" class="btn-primary" data-ga-event="call_click" data-ga-location="hero">
          <span data-i18n="cta_call_to_reserve">Call to Reserve</span> · {{ store.tel_display }}
        </a>
        {% else %}
        <p style="font-size:12px; color:rgba(251,241,222,.55); letter-spacing:.04em; padding-top:4px;"><span data-i18n="cta_reservation_soon">Reservation details coming soon</span></p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="scroll-arrow">↓</div>
  </section>

  <!-- MARQUEE -->
  <div class="marquee-wrap">
    <div class="marquee-track">
      <span class="marquee-item">{{ store.name_full_en }}</span>
      <span class="marquee-dot"></span>
      <span class="marquee-item" data-i18n="marquee_wagyu">Miyazaki Wagyu</span>
      <span class="marquee-dot"></span>
      <span class="marquee-item" data-i18n="marquee_muslim">Muslim-Friendly</span>
      <span class="marquee-dot"></span>
      <span class="marquee-item" data-i18n="marquee_fresh">Griddled Fresh, Every Morning</span>
      <span class="marquee-dot"></span>
      <span class="marquee-item" data-i18n="marquee_walkins">Walk-ins Welcome</span>
      <span class="marquee-dot"></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">{{ store.name_full_en }}</span>
      <span class="marquee-dot"></span>
      <span class="marquee-item" data-i18n="marquee_wagyu">Miyazaki Wagyu</span>
      <span class="marquee-dot"></span>
      <span class="marquee-item" data-i18n="marquee_muslim">Muslim-Friendly</span>
      <span class="marquee-dot"></span>
      <span class="marquee-item" data-i18n="marquee_fresh">Griddled Fresh, Every Morning</span>
      <span class="marquee-dot"></span>
      <span class="marquee-item" data-i18n="marquee_walkins">Walk-ins Welcome</span>
      <span class="marquee-dot"></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STORY SPLIT -->
  <section style="background:#fbf1de; padding:72px 24px;">
    <div style="max-width:1000px; margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="story-split">
        <div class="story-photo reveal">
          <img src="/assets/scrambled-egg-burger.png" alt="{{ store.name_full_en }} — Scrambled Egg Wagyu Burger" />
        </div>
        <div class="story-text-wrap reveal d1">
          <p class="label" style="margin-bottom:14px;" data-i18n="story_label">OUR MORNING RITUAL</p>
          <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces'; font-size:clamp(1.7rem,5.5vw,2.4rem); font-weight:600; line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:16px;">
            <span data-i18n="story_heading_line1">Same Miyazaki Wagyu.</span><br/>
            <span class="scribble" data-i18n="story_heading_line2_html">A whole new sunrise.
              <svg viewBox="0 0 300 20" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M2,12 C60,4 90,18 150,10 C210,2 250,16 298,8" fill="none" stroke="#f0a631" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </h2>
          <p style="font-size:.94rem; line-height:1.9; color:rgba(42,33,24,.7); font-weight:400; margin-bottom:16px;" data-i18n="story_para1">
            Long before lunch service begins, our griddles are already warm. We take the same 5th-generation Miyazaki Wagyu our steak house is known for, and shape it into a burger built for the first meal of the day — a fresh patty, a soft toasted bun, and a runny egg if you like one.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size:.94rem; line-height:1.9; color:rgba(42,33,24,.7); font-weight:400;" data-i18n="story_para2">
            Halal-certified from farm to griddle, so every guest — whatever their background — can start the day at the same table.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BURGER SHOWCASE -->
  <div class="img-frame" style="margin-bottom:0; background:#fbf1de;">
    <div class="img-frame-inner reveal" style="position:relative;">
      <img src="/assets/fried-egg-burger.png" alt="{{ store.name_full_en }} — Fried Egg Wagyu Burger" style="width:100%; display:block; aspect-ratio:16/9; object-fit:cover; object-position:center 20%;" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-gap"></div>

  <!-- MENU -->
  <section style="background:#fbf1de; padding:72px 24px;">
    <div style="max-width:900px; margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:40px;">
        <p class="label reveal" style="margin-bottom:12px;" data-i18n="menu_label">MORNING MENU</p>
        <h2 class="reveal" style="font-family:'Fraunces'; font-size:clamp(1.7rem,6vw,2.4rem); font-weight:600; line-height:1.2;" data-i18n="menu_heading_html">
          Start Your Day<br/>the Wagyu Way
        </h2>
        <span class="sun-rule reveal"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="menu-grid">
        <div class="menu-card reveal d1">
          <div class="menu-card-img-wrap">
            <div class="menu-card-img-wrap-inner">
              <img class="menu-card-img" src="/assets/scrambled-egg-burger.png" alt="Scrambled Egg Wagyu Burger" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="menu-card-body">
            <span class="menu-card-eyebrow">No.1</span>
